     "means": "his line taken literally, so the point lands before the caption is read"
    },
    {
     "move": "a mint ring draws round the driver on the word driving",
     "means": "the person at the wheel is the one answerable, never the machine"
    },
    {
     "move": "an excuse slip is stamped VOID",
     "means": "the AI did it is no defence"
    },
    {
     "move": "each AI mistake is signed with your name",
     "means": "owning its mistakes is the only way AI does not replace you"
    },
    {
     "move": "IBM's own page scrolls to its first paragraph and a highlighter draws across the number",
     "means": "bosses already rank checking and overruling AI first; staff mostly do not"
    },
    {
     "move": "a mint ink stamp lands on the picture",
     "means": "the excuse is void, the mistakes are yours, your job is already on the table"
    }
